# src/apps/android/app/src/test/java/com

## Purpose
Maintains the top-level namespace segment for local Android JVM tests.

## Contents
Contains the `luminet` namespace and nested application unit-test packages.

## Interfaces and dependencies
Participates in test source/package resolution by Gradle and the JVM compiler rather than exposing a runtime API.

## Invariants
The namespace hierarchy must match package declarations, remain test-only, and never become an alternate production implementation tree.